WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100
Now let’s show how to ride downhill
on Combo Ski. Never start,

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.800
on steep slopes or red ski runs.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.933
It’s always better to start on
flat terrain or gentle slopes.

4
00:00:11.866 --> 00:00:13.100
Always make sure,

5
00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:14.466
you are not tense,

6
00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:17.333
stay relaxed and keep your knees bent.

7
00:00:18.066 --> 00:00:19.700
I keep my knees bent,

8
00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:22.266
make short turns,

9
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.800
For better balance, I keep one foot

10
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.350
slightly in front of the other.

11
00:00:30.733 --> 00:00:32.900
At first, it may feel awkward,

12
00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:35.366
but over time you get used to it,

13
00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:43.250
gain confidence and use the hockey
stop to brake. As I mentioned,

14
00:00:43.266 --> 00:00:46.800
Keep one foot slightly in front
of the other for better balance.

15
00:00:50.966 --> 00:00:52.133
Common mistakes.

16
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:55.366
Never ski with straight
legs or try to snowplow.

17
00:00:55.433 --> 00:00:58.433
It doesn’t work and you are likely to fall.

18
00:00:58.766 --> 00:01:00.866
The key is to stay relaxed,

19
00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.050
especially in your knees.

20
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:07.433
After a short practice, you can
increase speed and slope angle,

21
00:01:08.066 --> 00:01:10.100
and start enjoying the ride more.

22
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:17.700
As you can see, thanks to the edges and the
upper strap, the ride is comfortable and safe.
